  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">224043_Piloting the Transhumance Conflict Sentinel (TCS) in Central Africa Republic (CAR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will build on the existing Transhumance in the Central African Republic Anticipatory Action tool by delivering:
 
  - Long term hosting and deployment of the tool on a virtual private server.
 
  - Strategic stakeholder engagement on hosting and sustainability, with a focus on Start Network members and government.
 
  - Training of Start Network members and partners on the tool and registering them for access.
 
  - Piloting the tool during the 2025 risk season, with the aim to raise Start Fund anticipation alert in the event a humanitarian crisis is forecast by the tool.</narrative>
  </description>
